  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Save An Elephants&apos; Home</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It is essential that we tend to the surrounding land in the vicinity where the elephants traverse regularly enroute to the further areas of the reserve. The operation involves the rehabilitation of previously cultivated land to a more stable and naturally representative state. Once we reach our target, we will be able to apply preventative management techniques to the surrounding land to prevent environmental degradation shaped by the elephants.</narrative>
  </description>
